    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does it charge 4 devices simultaneously?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes! It can charge up to <strong>4 devices simultaneously</strong>. It features:</p><ul><li><strong>Built-in USB-C cable</strong></li><li><strong>Built-in Lightning (iOS) cable</strong></li><li><strong>USB-C output port</strong></li><li><strong>USB-A output port</strong></li></ul><p>This makes it compatible with a wide range of devices including iPhones, iPads, AirPods, Samsung Galaxy, and more — all at the same time.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How fast does it charge iPhones?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>It charges iPhones quite fast thanks to its <strong>30W Power Delivery (PD)</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>iPhone 17 Pro Max hits 50% in just 27 minutes</strong></li><li>The built-in Lightning (iOS) cable supports up to <strong>20W</strong> output</li><li>The USB-C port and cable both support <strong>30W</strong> for even faster charging</li><li>With its 20,000mAh capacity, it can charge an iPhone multiple times on a single charge (reviewers mention up to <strong>3 full charges</strong> for an iPhone)</li></ul>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How long does the battery last?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>It has a large 20,000mAh battery, giving it impressive longevity:</p><ul><li><strong>Up to a full week</strong> of worry-free iPhone charging (per the product description)</li><li><strong>~3 full charges</strong> for an iPhone 17 Pro Max, confirmed by multiple customer reviews</li><li>A built-in <strong>LCD display</strong> shows real-time battery level so you always know when it needs recharging</li><li>The power bank itself recharges quickly via its 30W USB-C port</li></ul>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is it TSA-approved for flights?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes! It is <strong>airline-approved</strong>, as explicitly stated in the product listing.</p><p>Here's why it clears TSA guidelines:</p><ul><li><strong>Battery capacity</strong>: 77Wh — well under the FAA's 100Wh limit for carry-on power banks (no airline approval needed under 100Wh)</li><li><strong>Lithium-ion</strong> battery type, which is the standard accepted format for flights</li><li>The product description specifically calls it out as an <strong>\"essential travel companion\"</strong> and confirms it's airline-approved</li></ul><p>You can carry it in your <strong>carry-on bag</strong> without any issues. Just note that power banks are generally <strong>not allowed in checked luggage</strong> per TSA rules.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can I check the remaining battery level clearly?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes, an embedded LCD screen displays real-time remaining power, so you can avoid low-battery anxiety and arrange charging plans conveniently.<br/></p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
